---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const title = 'Privacy Policy';
const description = 'Privacy Policy for Meowmin — what data we collect, how we use it, and your rights.';
---

<Base title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="py-12 sm:py-16 px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-[720px] mx-auto">
      <a class="back inline-block mb-8 font-medium text-brand hover:text-brand-dark transition" href="/">&larr; Meowmin</a>

      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="subtitle text-gray-500 text-sm mb-10">Meowmin — Last updated: September 2026 · Includes Paddle web billing</p>

      <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-700">
        <p>Meowmin ("we", "our", "app") respects your privacy. This policy explains what data we collect, how we use it, and your rights regarding your information.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-6">Data We Collect</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Diary entries</strong> — The text you write in your daily reflections. Encrypted and stored securely (Turso DB). Your journal is yours alone.</li>
          <li><strong>Account information</strong> — Email address and display name if you sign in with Google. Anonymous users are not asked for this.</li>
          <li><strong>Approximate location</strong> — Used only for calculating accurate prayer times via the Adhan library. Never uploaded or shared.</li>
          <li><strong>Device information</strong> — Used solely for scheduling reminders (suhoor, iftar, night reminders).</li>
          <li><strong>Subscription status</strong> — Processed by <strong>Paddle.com Market Ltd</strong> (our Merchant of Record) and <strong>RevenueCat</strong> for entitlement sync. We never see or store your card, bank, or full payment details.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-6">How We Use Data</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>Diary text is sent to an AI provider to generate personalized Islamic reflections, suggested tasks, and Qur'anic references.</li>
          <li>Location is used locally on your device for prayer time calculation. It is not transmitted to our servers.</li>
          <li>Email is used only for account identification and support communication.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-6">User-Generated Content</h2>
        <p>Your diary entries are private to you. We do not display, share, or publish your diary content publicly. If you believe another user has violated our terms or if you need to report content, contact us at <a href="mailto:contact@taucity.xyz" class="text-brand hover:text-brand-dark transition">contact@taucity.xyz</a>.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-6">Data Sharing</h2>
        <p>We do not sell your data. Data is shared only with essential service providers:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Paddle.com Market Ltd</strong> — Our <strong>Merchant of Record</strong> for all web payments. Paddle collects your email, billing address, and payment method to process checkout, calculate VAT/GST, handle invoicing, and issue refunds. Your statement shows <code class="bg-gray-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm">PADDLE.NET* MEOWMIN</code>. We never see your card or bank details — Paddle does.</li>
          <li><strong>RevenueCat</strong> — Manages subscription entitlements, paywalls, and purchase verification (synced with Paddle). No payment details pass through our servers.</li>
          <li><strong>AI providers (Fanar / OpenRouter)</strong> — Process diary text to generate personalized Islamic reflections, Surah stories, and tasks. Your text is sent per request and not retained beyond processing.</li>
          <li><strong>Google (Firebase)</strong> — Provides authentication (Firebase Auth). Anonymous sign-in available.</li>
          <li><strong>Turso (LibSQL)</strong> — Our encrypted database for journal storage.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">For web checkout, Paddle is the data controller for payment information under Paddle’s <a href="https://www.paddle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline hover:text-gray-700">privacy policy</a>; we are the controller for your journal and account data. RevenueCat processes subscription status as a processor. See also our <a href="/refund" class="text-brand underline">Refund Policy</a> (all web refunds via Paddle) and <a href="/pricing" class="text-brand underline">Pricing</a>.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-6">Data Deletion</h2>
        <p>You can delete your account and all associated data at any time from within the app: <strong>Profile → Delete Account</strong>. Data is permanently removed from our servers within 30 days of deletion.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-6">Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p>This app does not contain external links or third-party advertisements.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-6">Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this policy from time to time. Changes will be reflected in the app and on this page.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 pt-6">Contact</h2>
        <p>For questions, data requests, or content reports:<br />
        Email: <a href="mailto:contact@taucity.xyz" class="text-brand hover:text-brand-dark transition">contact@taucity.xyz</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
